**BLUF**: I’ve added a quick animation‑preview module for the voice flow of Big and outlined three popular options you can pick from.

**Voice‑mode animation demo**

```kotlin
// BigVoiceDemo.kt
@Composable
fun VoiceDemo(
    animate: Boolean = true,
    animStyle: AnimationStyle = AnimationStyle.FADE
) {
    // tap mic icon
    IconButton(onClick = { /* trigger SpeechStateMachine */ }) {
        Icon(Icons.Default.Mic, contentDescription = "Start mic")
    }

    // animation block
    if (animate) {
        AnimatedVisibility(
            visible = true,
            enter = when (animStyle) {
                AnimationStyle.FADE -> fadeIn()
                AnimationStyle.SLIDE -> slideInVertically()
                AnimationStyle.ZOOM -> scaleIn()
            },
            exit = fadeOut()
        ) {
            Text("You said: “…”.", Modifier.fillMaxWidth())
            // Voice reply bubbles
            Text("Big says: …", Modifier.fillMaxWidth())
        }
    }
}

enum class AnimationStyle { FADE, SLIDE, ZOOM }
```

**Three animation options**

| Option | Visual style | When to use | Code snippet |
|--------|--------------|-------------|--------------|
| **Fade** | Simple fade‑in/out | Minimal change, clean look | `enter = fadeIn()` |
| **Slide** | Slide in from bottom | Emphasise new UI elements | `enter = slideInVertically()` |
| **Zoom** | Scale from center | Highlight action or response | `enter = scaleIn()` |

